            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Search the web for recent papers (2023-2026) on curriculum learning for transformers / large language models, specifically: (1) papers showing that curriculum ordering provides significant vs. marginal benefits for transformer models; (2) any negative results or mixed results about curriculum learning for LLMs; (3) curriculum learning for compositional generalization. I need to assess whether the claim \"curriculum ordering matters significantly for OOD generalization\" is well-supported or controversial in the current literature. Use WebSearch if available, otherwise report what you know. Keep findings concise."
            }
